menu "COS Display Configuration"

config COS_DISPLAY_LOW_MEMORY_CONSOLE
    bool "Low-memory console render path (no row sprite)"
    default y
    help
        Render console text rows directly to the LCD instead of allocating a
        16bpp row sprite. Saves 3.75-11.25 KB of RAM depending on text size at
        the cost of higher per-row SPI overhead. Disable to restore the legacy
        row-sprite path.

endmenu
